WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:03.000
-Welcome, welcome to
"The Tonight Show," everybody.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:05.267
You're here, you made it.
Happy Thursday.

00:00:05.267 --> 00:00:07.400
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:08.868
Well, guys, this is fun.

00:00:08.868 --> 00:00:11.167
I saw that today
is National Prom Day.

00:00:11.167 --> 00:00:13.200
[ Audience "Ohs" ]

00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:16.167
Yeah, it's prom
in the COVID era.

00:00:16.167 --> 00:00:17.968
I went to Catholic school,
so I was actually

00:00:17.968 --> 00:00:19.968
socially distancing
before it was cool.

00:00:19.968 --> 00:00:21.200
[ Laughter ]

00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:24.400
Leave room for the holy ghost.

00:00:24.400 --> 00:00:26.400
My advice, get a nice outfit,
comb your hair,

00:00:26.400 --> 00:00:28.167
and spend at least one minute
in the sun

00:00:28.167 --> 00:00:29.901
so your prom photo doesn't look
like a Polaroid

00:00:29.901 --> 00:00:31.300
before you shake it.

00:00:31.300 --> 00:00:34.634
[ Laughter ]

00:00:34.634 --> 00:00:38.501
Hi -- Hi, Ladee.

00:00:38.501 --> 00:00:39.968
Let's get to some news.

00:00:39.968 --> 00:00:43.300
After more than two years,
the CDC is no longer warning

00:00:43.300 --> 00:00:46.868
travelers about COVID
risks on cruises.

00:00:46.868 --> 00:00:49.434
You know the CDC is tired
when they start releasing

00:00:49.434 --> 00:00:51.267
statements like,
"Do whatever you want.

00:00:51.267 --> 00:00:52.400
I..."

00:00:52.400 --> 00:00:54.000
[ Laughter ]

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:55.868
At this point it's like going
sky diving.

00:00:55.868 --> 00:00:57.834
I'm pretty sure we all
understand the risk, right?

00:00:57.834 --> 00:00:59.167
It's like --
[ Laughter ]

00:00:59.167 --> 00:01:01.334
And get this, in Washington,
the House is expected

00:01:01.334 --> 00:01:03.767
to pass a marijuana
legalization bill this week.

00:01:03.767 --> 00:01:06.434
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:06.434 --> 00:01:07.934
[ Note plays ]

00:01:07.934 --> 00:01:09.667
And people on both sides
of the aisle have started

00:01:09.667 --> 00:01:11.334
releasing statements
about the whole thing.

00:01:11.334 --> 00:01:12.767
Here, check out
what they had to say.

00:01:12.767 --> 00:01:14.701
First up, Congressman
French Hill said,

00:01:14.701 --> 00:01:16.734
"I don't believe we should
legalize marijuana,

00:01:16.734 --> 00:01:19.868
and I'm willing to die on this,
well, my last name."

00:01:19.868 --> 00:01:22.501
[ Laughter ]

00:01:22.501 --> 00:01:25.100
Next up, Congressman
Josh Harder said,

00:01:25.100 --> 00:01:27.367
"I do believe we should legalize
marijuana, but Republicans

00:01:27.367 --> 00:01:30.167
are making the process much,
well, my last name."

00:01:30.167 --> 00:01:33.601
[ Laughter ]

00:01:33.601 --> 00:01:35.567
Then Susan Congresswoman
Susan Wild said,

00:01:35.567 --> 00:01:38.767
"Let's just legalize it so momma
can go pop a gummy and go buck,

00:01:38.767 --> 00:01:40.467
well, my last name."

00:01:40.467 --> 00:01:45.067
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:45.067 --> 00:01:48.400
Then Congressman Colin Allred
said, "Yeah, let's do this.

00:01:48.400 --> 00:01:50.067
I won't stop until everyone's
eyes are all,

00:01:50.067 --> 00:01:51.200
well, my last name."

00:01:51.200 --> 00:01:53.133
[ Laughter ]

00:01:53.133 --> 00:01:55.467
Then Congressman Jim McGovern
said, "If we legalize it,

00:01:55.467 --> 00:01:57.901
maybe McDonald's will name
a sandwich after us called

00:01:57.901 --> 00:01:59.434
the, well, my last name."

00:01:59.434 --> 00:02:00.834
[ Laughter ]

00:02:00.834 --> 00:02:04.501
And finally Senator Roy Blunt
said, "No comment."

00:02:04.501 --> 00:02:06.067
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:06.067 --> 00:02:07.400
[ Rim shot ]

00:02:07.400 --> 00:02:08.834
He didn't want to say --

00:02:08.834 --> 00:02:11.267
He didn't feel
like saying anything.

00:02:11.267 --> 00:02:12.501
Some TV news.

00:02:12.501 --> 00:02:14.634
I read that the second season
of "Bridgerton"

00:02:14.634 --> 00:02:19.000
set a Netflix record
for opening weekend views.

00:02:19.000 --> 00:02:20.667
Yep, Netflix said they're gonna
celebrate the only way

00:02:20.667 --> 00:02:22.968
they know how -- by raising
subscription fees.

00:02:22.968 --> 00:02:24.434
[ Laughter ]

00:02:24.434 --> 00:02:27.334
Yeah, in one weekend
"Bridgerton" got 193 million

00:02:27.334 --> 00:02:28.934
hours of viewing time.

00:02:28.934 --> 00:02:30.133
Yeah.
[ Audience "Oohs" ]

00:02:30.133 --> 00:02:32.400
That's like your mom's version
of "Encanto."

00:02:32.400 --> 00:02:34.100
[ Laughter ]

00:02:34.100 --> 00:02:36.133
I saw that Google Chrome --
this is real --

00:02:36.133 --> 00:02:39.968
they just unveiled a new update,
and they debuted a refreshed,

00:02:39.968 --> 00:02:41.567
redesigned logo.

00:02:41.567 --> 00:02:44.133
This is real.
First, here's the old logo.

00:02:44.133 --> 00:02:47.334
Uh-huh. Now, let's see the new,
refreshed logo.

00:02:47.334 --> 00:02:50.033
[ Laughter ]

00:02:50.033 --> 00:02:51.567
Google is like,
"Before you make fun of it,

00:02:51.567 --> 00:02:53.601
just remember we have
all of your search history.

00:02:53.601 --> 00:02:55.501
Okay, just saying."
[ Laughter ]

00:02:55.501 --> 00:02:57.501
Well, listen to this,
the vacuum company Dyson

00:02:57.501 --> 00:03:00.133
is coming out with its own
noise-cancelling headphones

00:03:00.133 --> 00:03:02.100
that have a built-in
air purifier.

00:03:02.100 --> 00:03:03.267
Take a look at these things.

00:03:03.267 --> 00:03:06.100
[ Laughter ]

00:03:06.100 --> 00:03:08.634
Dyson, looks more
like Beats by Bane.

00:03:08.634 --> 00:03:10.667
Uh, it's kind of cool.

00:03:10.667 --> 00:03:12.701
You're just one visor away
from being in Daft Punk.

00:03:12.701 --> 00:03:13.868
I think it's interesting.

00:03:13.868 --> 00:03:15.167
[ Laughter ]

00:03:15.167 --> 00:03:16.734
Hey, I heard about a man
in the U.K.

00:03:16.734 --> 00:03:18.667
who says that he saved a ton
of money on gas

00:03:18.667 --> 00:03:21.133
because he drives
the world's smallest car.

00:03:21.133 --> 00:03:22.767
Here he is.

00:03:22.767 --> 00:03:24.567
[ Audience "Aws" ]

00:03:24.567 --> 00:03:26.334
He's like, "Be honest,
does the blue paint job

00:03:26.334 --> 00:03:27.601
make it look stupid?"

00:03:27.601 --> 00:03:29.033
[ Laughter ]

00:03:29.033 --> 00:03:30.901
And finally, at an airport
in Chicago,

00:03:30.901 --> 00:03:33.367
a drunk man scaled
a barbed wire fence,

00:03:33.367 --> 00:03:35.901
got onto the runway,
stripped out of his clothes,

00:03:35.901 --> 00:03:38.567
and tried to stop a plane
from taking off.

00:03:38.567 --> 00:03:39.767
[ Light laughter ]

00:03:39.767 --> 00:03:41.734
Yep, even crazier,
that's also how they board

00:03:41.734 --> 00:03:43.667
Group C on Southwest.
We have a great show.

